  description:
  - When a structure is destroyed, it will occassionally leave behind a pile of rubble.
    Spending resources and completing a quick microgame will repair the structure.
    Otherwise, they can be removed via shoveling.
  - Structures destroyed by fire do not leave behind any piles.
  leftText: 
  rightText: When a structure is destroyed, it will often leave behind a pile of
    rubble. Each structure requires unique items to repair, as well as some sealant.
    Otherwise, they can be removed via shoveling. Structures destroyed by fire do
    not leave behind any piles.
